-shuling:p001:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"高宗","kind":"person","person_id":"icd_mkz_d9n","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-036-wangyang-shuling","book_id":"b-chenshu-036","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-036-wangyang-shuling-ws1530928"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-liujingyan:p002","text":"初，宣帝居鄉里，先娶吳興錢氏，及即位，拜貴妃，甚有寵。后傾心下之，每尚方供奉物，其上者皆推于貴妃，而己御其次焉。宣帝崩，始興王叔陵為亂，後主賴后與吳媼救而獲免。後主即位，尊后為皇太后，宮曰弘範。是時新失淮南地，隋師臨江，又國遭大喪，後主患創不能聽政。其誅叔陵，供大行喪事，邊境防守及百司眾務，雖假後主之敕，實皆決之於后。後主創愈，乃歸政焉。后性謙謹，未嘗以宗族為請，雖衣食亦無所分遺。陳亡，入長安。隋大業十二年，薨於東都，年八十三。葬於洛陽之芒山。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-012-liujingyan:p002:m0012","surface":"錢氏","start":12,"end":14,"person_id":"b13_njz_24q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-liujingyan:p002:m0063","surface":"叔陵","start":63,"end":65,"person_id":"icd_mkz_d9n_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-liujingyan:p002:m0073","surface":"吳媼","start":73,"end":75,"person_id":"sfs_3hb_c13","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-liujingyan:p002:m0088","surface":"皇太后","start":88,"end":91,"person_id":"5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-liujingyan:p002:m0127","surface":"叔陵","start":127,"end":129,"person_id":"icd_mkz_d9n_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2060595,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":92,"last_line":92,"line_start":0,"line_end":255,"raw_start":4544,"raw_end":4799,"raw_character_offsets":[4544,4545,4546,4547,4548,4549,4550,4551,4552,4553,4554,4555,4556,4557,4558,4559,4560,4561,4562,4563,4564,4565,4566,4567,4568,4569,4570,4573,4576,4577,4578,4579,4580,4581,4582,4583,4584,4585,4586,4587,4588,4589,4590,